    [Doc][Misc] Restructure section 5.2 PD separation into tab layout for DeepSeek-V4-Pro (#19809)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    Restructure Section 5.2 Multi-Node PD Separation Deployment in the
    DeepSeek-V4-Pro tutorial to match the tab layout used by Section 5.3.
    
    1. Convert the three numbered subsections (5.2.1 A3 / 5.2.2 A2 / 5.2.3
    950DT) into tabs in the same order as Section 5.3: **950DT products** →
    **A3 series** → **A2 series**. Section contents are unchanged (only
    indented inside the tabs); anchors are preserved as `{:
    #dsv4pro-5-2-950dt }` / `{: #dsv4pro-5-2-a3 }` / `{: #dsv4pro-5-2-a2 }`.
    2. Refine DeepSeek-V4-Pro doc: unify PD deployment scripts and parameter
    descriptions.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    Docs only. No code changes.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    Docs-only change; verified that each subsection body is byte-identical
    to the original (excluding indentation) via a line-by-line comparison,
    and that the resulting doc is identical to the releases/v0.30.0 PR
    counterpart.
    
